1
00:00:01,760 --> 00:00:03,297
What is that?!

2
00:00:03,380 --> 00:00:07,537
Weren't Avdol's flames supposed
to be able to sense anything?!

3
00:00:07,620 --> 00:00:10,140
Avdol, where are you?!

4
00:00:11,400 --> 00:00:12,230
Avdol...

5
00:00:12,313 --> 00:00:14,580
has been reduced to nothingness.

6
00:00:15,100 --> 00:00:19,020
You were arrogant enough to
believe you could defeat Lord Dio.

7
00:00:19,320 --> 00:00:22,780
Allow me to demonstrate
just how wrong you were.

8
00:00:27,080 --> 00:00:29,960
You will fall in line, one by one,

9
00:00:30,360 --> 00:00:34,780
as I scatter your atomic fragments
across the recesses of the Void.

10
00:00:41,340 --> 00:00:42,660
It can't be!

11
00:00:43,660 --> 00:00:45,320
I don't believe you!

12
00:00:46,060 --> 00:00:47,060
Avdol's not dead!

13
00:00:48,620 --> 00:00:50,540
Don't you lie to me!

14
00:00:53,500 --> 00:00:54,330
What?

15
00:00:55,140 --> 00:00:57,457
I never would have
imagined Polareth's stand

16
00:00:57,540 --> 00:00:59,817
could attack this
swiftly from so far away.

17
00:00:59,900 --> 00:01:01,720
An amazing feat to be sure.

18
00:01:02,400 --> 00:01:03,240
Over here!

19
00:01:03,520 --> 00:01:05,932
I want you to look at me when I kill you!

20
00:01:34,340 --> 00:01:35,497
I'll see you

21
00:01:35,580 --> 00:01:42,580
next

22
00:01:48,040 --> 00:01:48,870
time.

23
00:01:52,780 --> 00:01:55,360
It's coming to the end of the battle

24
00:01:56,860 --> 00:02:02,740
I'm going to hit the video
of the world Stop it now!

25
00:02:05,280 --> 00:02:09,557
It's the beginning of the story
I'm going to take the moment

26
00:02:09,640 --> 00:02:14,900
I'm going to continue to go I'm
going to continue to go Crusaders

27
00:02:16,700 --> 00:02:23,460
The last page of the
last page Take it away!

28
00:02:24,520 --> 00:02:27,777
It's the end of the world...

29
00:02:27,860 --> 00:02:31,640
You have my memory...

30
00:02:38,920 --> 00:02:39,750
Olaaaaaa!

31
00:02:48,040 --> 00:02:48,870
Huh?!

32
00:02:49,200 --> 00:02:52,400
Alright, now I'm sure
something fishy is going on.

33
00:02:52,580 --> 00:02:55,857
Ever since we escaped the Mirage,
I've heard the sounds of a battle.

34
00:02:55,940 --> 00:02:56,770
Blast it!

35
00:02:56,860 --> 00:02:58,860
Avdol and Polnareff are out there!

36
00:03:03,380 --> 00:03:04,380
Damn that guy!

37
00:03:04,680 --> 00:03:07,517
I know I hit the bastard, but
it wasn't enough to kill him!

38
00:03:07,600 --> 00:03:10,957
He just swallowed himself again
so he could hide in that abyss!

39
00:03:11,040 --> 00:03:12,687
Damn that guy and his stand!

40
00:03:21,260 --> 00:03:23,480
Avdol, how could you do that?

41
00:03:23,740 --> 00:03:26,660
How could you break the
one rule you gave us?

42
00:03:27,140 --> 00:03:30,022
Bulldoref, Iggy, you have
to get out of here now!

43
00:03:30,340 --> 00:03:32,980
You told us we had to watch our own backs!

44
00:03:33,200 --> 00:03:36,259
That you wouldn't save us
even if we were in danger!

45
00:03:36,760 --> 00:03:37,800
You liar!

46
00:03:40,000 --> 00:03:42,337
You've been meddling in
other people's business

47
00:03:42,420 --> 00:03:45,040
ever since the moment
we set foot in India!

48
00:03:45,740 --> 00:03:46,940
Damn it, Avdol!

49
00:03:47,200 --> 00:03:51,553
Why couldn't you just leave me alone
and mind your own freaking business?!

50
00:03:53,780 --> 00:03:56,900
If I hadn't ducked, I'd
be a dead man right now!

51
00:03:57,840 --> 00:04:00,252
It's like fate is telling me to carry on!

52
00:04:00,600 --> 00:04:03,894
This must be Avdol's way of
knocking some sense into me!

53
00:04:18,180 --> 00:04:20,004
It's way too dangerous in here!

54
00:04:20,740 --> 00:04:21,740
Let's get moving!

55
00:04:31,660 --> 00:04:32,760
Come on, Iggy!

56
00:04:32,940 --> 00:04:34,497
We have to make it upstairs!

57
00:04:34,580 --> 00:04:35,820
Don't fall behind!

58
00:04:45,040 --> 00:04:45,870
Look up ahead!

59
00:04:45,953 --> 00:04:46,783
It's the exit!

60
00:04:46,866 --> 00:04:47,898
We're almost there!

61
00:04:49,360 --> 00:04:52,380
But I won't just turn tail and run away!

62
00:04:53,880 --> 00:04:57,837
Avdol sacrificed himself for us, and
I'll repay that debt no matter what!

63
00:04:57,920 --> 00:05:01,757
He believed we had the power to
put an end to Dio once and for all!

64
00:05:01,840 --> 00:05:04,677
I can't betray his faith
in us by letting him down!

65
00:05:04,760 --> 00:05:06,054
That is not an option!

66
00:05:07,960 --> 00:05:11,660
I refuse to take the easy way
out like some common coward!

67
00:05:12,140 --> 00:05:14,957
I'm gonna see this fight
through to the bitter end!

68
00:05:15,040 --> 00:05:18,040
The only place I'm running
to is Dio's shadow den!

69
00:05:25,600 --> 00:05:27,820
So up the stairs we go!

70
00:05:36,360 --> 00:05:39,100
I expected him to dash out the door.

71
00:05:39,900 --> 00:05:40,730
Pity.

72
00:05:43,740 --> 00:05:46,100
Impressive, he managed a hit.

73
00:05:46,520 --> 00:05:49,637
It seems Polnareff's mental
fortitude gives him the

74
00:05:49,720 --> 00:05:53,191
ability to conquer his fears
in the face of imminent death.

75
00:05:53,400 --> 00:05:56,640
You will soon be joining
Avdol, rest assured.

76
00:05:57,180 --> 00:06:01,709
Your strength pales in comparison to
the harbinger of death that is my stand.

77
00:06:03,060 --> 00:06:04,640
If what he says is true,

78
00:06:05,020 --> 00:06:08,037
his stand's jaws are the gateway
to an alternate dimension,

79
00:06:08,120 --> 00:06:10,077
a dark unimaginable abyss.

80
00:06:10,160 --> 00:06:15,042
One that allows him to move through our
realm without leaving any trace of himself!

81
00:06:16,860 --> 00:06:18,540
But how does he do it?

82
00:06:19,680 --> 00:06:22,209
And how the heck am I
supposed to beat him?

83
00:06:29,080 --> 00:06:30,220
Oh no, no!

84
00:06:30,460 --> 00:06:31,440
He's cut us off!

85
00:06:33,300 --> 00:06:34,140
He's nearby!

86
00:06:34,720 --> 00:06:35,960
But where exactly?

87
00:06:36,480 --> 00:06:38,480
Iggy, I need you to watch my back!

88
00:06:40,160 --> 00:06:42,631
And don't worry, I'll do the same for you!

89
00:06:59,400 --> 00:07:03,517
Okay, if he wants to reach us, then he's
gonna have to come out of that other realm.

90
00:07:03,600 --> 00:07:04,440
This is good.

91
00:07:04,720 --> 00:07:07,337
He has to come out from the
dark beyond at some point.

92
00:07:07,420 --> 00:07:12,008
But when he does, I'll take my chance
and attack him with everything I've got!

93
00:07:12,140 --> 00:07:14,580
Alright, come at me you demented pinball!

94
00:07:14,880 --> 00:07:16,340
I'll slice you in two!

95
00:07:16,620 --> 00:07:19,267
Now I pissed off so my
chariot's even faster!

96
00:07:19,500 --> 00:07:24,400
I may have lost Avdol, but it'll be a cool
day in hell before I let you get away!

97
00:07:37,700 --> 00:07:38,860
What the hell?

98
00:07:39,200 --> 00:07:40,880
He was hiding under my foot!

99
00:07:41,500 --> 00:07:42,560
Carry up!

100
00:07:51,840 --> 00:07:53,100
My foot!

101
00:07:53,820 --> 00:07:55,660
Now you can't run away.

102
00:07:56,620 --> 00:07:59,780
I got your foot so that
you can't hide anymore.

103
00:08:04,100 --> 00:08:05,280
Eat silver!

104
00:08:06,080 --> 00:08:07,000
I'll pass.

105
00:08:21,120 --> 00:08:21,950
Mr.

106
00:08:22,033 --> 00:08:23,387
Joestar, a brawl's underway.

107
00:08:23,640 --> 00:08:24,920
Avdol and Polnareff.

108
00:08:25,020 --> 00:08:28,437
Sounds like they came in after us and
wound up getting themselves into a fight.

109
00:08:28,520 --> 00:08:29,520
Come on, you two!

110
00:08:29,760 --> 00:08:31,400
We have to find them ASAP!

111
00:08:37,160 --> 00:08:40,240
You've managed to hide
amid the chaos, Polnareff.

112
00:08:41,680 --> 00:08:42,840
How futile.

113
00:08:43,140 --> 00:08:45,637
You couldn't have gone
far with that injury.

114
00:08:45,720 --> 00:08:48,367
Which means you're hiding
beneath the rubble.

115
00:08:52,940 --> 00:08:56,277
By now you must have realized
you're helpless against me.

116
00:08:56,360 --> 00:08:58,419
You shall meet your end by my hand.

117
00:08:59,880 --> 00:09:02,797
Now then, where could you be, Polnareff?

118
00:09:02,880 --> 00:09:05,500
That's quite the ruckus, Cool Ice.

119
00:09:11,640 --> 00:09:12,740
Lord Dio!

120
00:09:14,880 --> 00:09:16,480
Please be careful, my lord.

121
00:09:16,680 --> 00:09:20,677
I believe Polnareff and that four-legged
rudin are still hiding nearby.

122
00:09:20,760 --> 00:09:22,701
Allow me to handle the situation.

123
00:09:23,000 --> 00:09:26,294
You mustn't trouble yourself
with such nonsense, Master.

124
00:09:38,660 --> 00:09:43,997
a fake deal made from the
fool we got him you'd think

125
00:09:44,080 --> 00:09:47,017
i'd feel guilty about attacking
from behind like a coward

126
00:09:47,100 --> 00:09:51,137
and you'd be wrong because
you pulled the same shit on

127
00:09:51,220 --> 00:09:56,140
avdol this is the death you
deserve now iggy crucify him

128
00:10:06,360 --> 00:10:08,480
Now, Iggy, crucify him!

129
00:10:08,640 --> 00:10:10,137
Make him pay for what he did.

130
00:10:10,220 --> 00:10:13,297
End his life in the same
merciless way he did Avdol's.

131
00:10:13,380 --> 00:10:14,980
Send him straight to hell!

132
00:10:21,200 --> 00:10:24,280
You're kidding! He knows! But how?

133
00:10:25,140 --> 00:10:29,199
Because the windows to my left are
letting in the light from the sun.

134
00:10:29,500 --> 00:10:32,559
Lord Dio would never enter
this room during the day.

135
00:10:33,740 --> 00:10:36,740
You'll suffer a thousand
deaths for your deception.

136
00:10:37,340 --> 00:10:38,170
Iggy!

137
00:10:47,820 --> 00:10:51,340
I made a vow to Lord Dio that
I would kill you interlopers.

138
00:10:51,680 --> 00:10:53,562
He entrusted me with that honor.

139
00:10:53,760 --> 00:10:55,457
Lord Dio's a man of his word.

140
00:10:55,540 --> 00:10:58,457
He would never descend to the
second floor for any reason.

141
00:10:58,540 --> 00:10:59,370
No!

142
00:10:59,453 --> 00:11:00,317
He's gonna kill Iggy!

143
00:11:00,400 --> 00:11:02,960
He's about to be swallowed by the abyss!

144
00:11:03,500 --> 00:11:05,860
Now die, you filthy, pathetic dog!

145
00:11:06,880 --> 00:11:10,880
Your incorrigible ruse forced me
to destroy Lord Dio's likeness!

146
00:11:18,700 --> 00:11:20,860
Did he really just hit him?

147
00:11:21,380 --> 00:11:22,920
He didn't use the void!

148
00:11:23,380 --> 00:11:26,204
Instead of killing Iggy,
he went in for a punch!

149
00:11:28,000 --> 00:11:29,840
Do you know what you've done?

150
00:11:30,620 --> 00:11:32,500
I don't care if it was a fake.

151
00:11:32,660 --> 00:11:35,757
You forced me to destroy a
figure in the form of Lord Dio,

152
00:11:35,840 --> 00:11:37,980
and you must answer for that crime.

153
00:11:39,520 --> 00:11:41,240
Your life is mine now!

154
00:11:41,520 --> 00:11:42,991
I will kick you to death!

155
00:11:46,920 --> 00:11:49,917
My dark abyss could swallow
you whole in an instant,

156
00:11:50,000 --> 00:11:52,529
but a quick death
wouldn't satiate my fury.

157
00:11:53,700 --> 00:11:56,180
This whole mess, it's all your fault!

158
00:11:56,540 --> 00:11:58,857
This is what happens
to those who anger me!

159
00:11:58,940 --> 00:12:00,881
Have you learned your lesson yet?

160
00:12:01,240 --> 00:12:06,780
How about it? Is this better?
Tell me! Is it? Is it? Is it?

161
00:12:08,040 --> 00:12:09,820
Stop it! Leave him alone!

162
00:12:10,480 --> 00:12:12,715
It's like Cool Ice's brain has melted!

163
00:12:13,200 --> 00:12:15,357
Is he really going batshit
because he destroyed

164
00:12:15,440 --> 00:12:17,734
some pile of sand that looked like Dio?

165
00:12:18,440 --> 00:12:21,400
From over here, his
soul is the murky abyss.

166
00:12:21,600 --> 00:12:23,597
It's a bottomless black
hole that obliterates

167
00:12:23,680 --> 00:12:26,033
any and everything that gets in its way!

168
00:12:28,940 --> 00:12:30,577
I was warned about the humans.

169
00:12:30,660 --> 00:12:34,777
Lord Dio said the Resolve in their
hearts must never be underestimated.

170
00:12:34,860 --> 00:12:37,860
But you, you're just a flea-bitten stray.

171
00:12:38,160 --> 00:12:42,160
You've never known Resolve, and you
certainly know nothing of pride.

172
00:12:46,300 --> 00:12:47,720
Yeah, Grand V!

173
00:12:48,020 --> 00:12:49,380
Leave him alone!

174
00:12:49,660 --> 00:12:51,200
You like that, do you?

175
00:12:51,720 --> 00:12:53,060
What did I say?

176
00:12:53,240 --> 00:12:56,380
Come on, your suffering's
just begun! Cool ice!

177
00:12:56,640 --> 00:12:58,320
You're dealing with me now!

178
00:13:02,620 --> 00:13:05,040
I'm ending this, Polnareff.

179
00:13:12,160 --> 00:13:12,990
Damn it!

180
00:13:14,700 --> 00:13:15,600
He's gone!

181
00:13:16,680 --> 00:13:18,280
But more importantly, Iggy!

182
00:13:18,560 --> 00:13:21,217
Our plan to trick Cool Ice
may have fallen through,

183
00:13:21,300 --> 00:13:23,594
but your sand might have just saved us.

184
00:13:23,680 --> 00:13:27,033
Thanks to you, I think I found
a way to find the bastard.

185
00:13:36,800 --> 00:13:38,271
Yeah, that's him alright.

186
00:13:38,460 --> 00:13:40,107
I can see him moving around.

187
00:13:40,560 --> 00:13:43,325
Guess your stand power
is a double-edged sword.

188
00:13:43,660 --> 00:13:48,300
When you move, your stand has no choice
but to absorb everything in your path.

189
00:13:48,860 --> 00:13:52,860
So choke on a mouthful of this and
get over here, you piece of shit!

190
00:13:53,060 --> 00:13:57,472
As soon as you come out from behind
your stand's putrid teeth to attack me,

191
00:13:58,060 --> 00:14:00,760
I'll turn the tables and finish you off!

192
00:14:02,300 --> 00:14:04,320
Bullseye, yeah! Eat that!

193
00:14:05,180 --> 00:14:06,797
Well, would you look at that.

194
00:14:06,880 --> 00:14:08,762
I found your weakness, Cool Ice.

195
00:14:08,920 --> 00:14:12,157
Any attempt to pinpoint my
location leaves you vulnerable,

196
00:14:12,240 --> 00:14:14,997
which is probably a tad
inconvenient since you can't

197
00:14:15,080 --> 00:14:17,962
see me without emerging
from your dark dimension.

198
00:14:18,640 --> 00:14:19,680
It's over!

199
00:14:20,060 --> 00:14:23,200
Now suck on my sword and
burn in hell, field-a-put!

200
00:14:23,540 --> 00:14:25,060
Hurry up and die!

201
00:14:33,840 --> 00:14:34,670
What?

202
00:14:34,880 --> 00:14:36,460
How are you still alive?

203
00:14:36,800 --> 00:14:39,100
I skew in your throat and brain stem!

204
00:14:39,480 --> 00:14:40,900
Would you die already?

205
00:14:43,820 --> 00:14:45,702
No way you're getting out of it!

206
00:14:45,840 --> 00:14:47,497
Hurry up and die!

207
00:14:47,580 --> 00:14:51,280
Stop making me repeat myself! Die! Die!

208
00:14:54,780 --> 00:14:56,220
I cannot die.

209
00:14:56,480 --> 00:14:59,362
My mission is far too
important to feel any pain.

210
00:14:59,580 --> 00:15:01,680
I will not rest until I kill you.

211
00:15:01,860 --> 00:15:05,797
I'll swallow Iggy, the Joestars,
and anyone else who gets in my way.

212
00:15:05,880 --> 00:15:08,821
Only after your deaths
will I allow myself to die.

213
00:15:16,460 --> 00:15:17,290
Bastard!

214
00:15:17,373 --> 00:15:18,440
There's a good boy.

215
00:15:18,600 --> 00:15:20,177
You knew to withdraw your sword.

216
00:15:20,260 --> 00:15:22,620
I also know that you're about to die!

217
00:15:26,180 --> 00:15:27,480
This is the one.

218
00:15:27,720 --> 00:15:29,820
The vile arm you used to stab me.

219
00:15:35,860 --> 00:15:37,420
Knock it off!

220
00:15:38,660 --> 00:15:39,520
Damn it!

221
00:15:39,760 --> 00:15:43,020
I had no choice but to shove him away! No!

222
00:15:44,300 --> 00:15:45,829
You're not going anywhere!

223
00:15:48,100 --> 00:15:49,157
Did I get him?

224
00:15:49,240 --> 00:15:50,920
Where'd he go now?

225
00:15:53,740 --> 00:15:54,570
Shit!

226
00:15:54,660 --> 00:15:55,700
He got my leg!

227
00:15:55,960 --> 00:15:57,080
I can't move!

228
00:15:57,520 --> 00:16:00,049
But I can't think about
the pain right now!

229
00:16:00,260 --> 00:16:04,060
I was so close, I almost
managed to land a killing blow.

230
00:16:04,380 --> 00:16:05,600
But he got away!

231
00:16:06,020 --> 00:16:09,300
This guy is different,
fueled by pure vengeance.

232
00:16:09,680 --> 00:16:11,033
And he's not just nuts.

233
00:16:11,320 --> 00:16:13,660
His devotion to Dio is all-consuming.

234
00:16:13,940 --> 00:16:16,240
But I won't let him get the upper hand.

235
00:16:16,420 --> 00:16:18,077
You said you couldn't die yet?

236
00:16:18,160 --> 00:16:20,500
Well, I can't die until I kill you!

237
00:16:22,560 --> 00:16:24,240
Okay, here he comes!

238
00:16:24,640 --> 00:16:25,480
Take this!

239
00:16:27,560 --> 00:16:28,900
Shit! It's no use!

240
00:16:29,080 --> 00:16:31,777
His stand just obliterated
the tip of my sword!

241
00:16:31,860 --> 00:16:34,317
Though it probably wouldn't
matter even if it were intact.

242
00:16:34,400 --> 00:16:37,437
It's impossible to attack him
when he's hidden in the abyss.

243
00:16:37,520 --> 00:16:40,873
If I so much as touch that
thing, it'll swallow me whole!

244
00:16:43,900 --> 00:16:44,730
Great!

245
00:16:44,813 --> 00:16:47,051
Now he's absorbing the building at random!

246
00:16:50,300 --> 00:16:51,130
That's clever.

247
00:16:51,400 --> 00:16:54,117
He knows full well I'll go
after him if he shows himself.

248
00:16:54,200 --> 00:16:57,671
So he's blindly attacking to
prevent me from fighting back.

249
00:16:57,900 --> 00:16:59,320
He's not messing around.

250
00:16:59,580 --> 00:17:01,797
At this rate, he's going
to hit me for sure.

251
00:17:01,880 --> 00:17:04,645
I should pull back Chariot
and think of a plan.

252
00:17:10,580 --> 00:17:12,420
Damn, this isn't good.

253
00:17:12,980 --> 00:17:15,457
He's not going to last long
if he keeps losing blood.

254
00:17:15,540 --> 00:17:20,128
From the state he's in, I'd say his
broken ribs must have punctured his lungs.

255
00:17:27,820 --> 00:17:30,297
And just when I thought
this couldn't get any worse,

256
00:17:30,380 --> 00:17:32,674
why the hell is he devouring the walls?

257
00:17:36,180 --> 00:17:39,097
Wait a second, I'm starting
to think I was all wrong.

258
00:17:39,180 --> 00:17:40,239
This isn't random.

259
00:17:40,520 --> 00:17:43,285
It was all part of his
plan from the beginning.

260
00:17:43,580 --> 00:17:45,617
He's been drawing circles around me,

261
00:17:45,700 --> 00:17:48,700
and with every lap, he's
getting closer and closer!

262
00:17:50,020 --> 00:17:53,457
The odds are stacked against
me, but I have to do something.

263
00:17:53,540 --> 00:17:54,660
He's closing in!

264
00:17:55,340 --> 00:17:57,399
