290
00:19:43,720 --> 00:19:44,980
It's no use!

291
00:19:46,580 --> 00:19:47,680
What do you know?

292
00:19:47,960 --> 00:19:50,254
The answer ended up being option three.

293
00:19:51,020 --> 00:19:52,160
Life's a bitch!

294
00:19:54,580 --> 00:19:58,580
Silver Chariot is a finesse-oriented
stand that fights with a saber.

295
00:19:58,740 --> 00:20:01,757
It simply doesn't have the
power to pull my body weight,

296
00:20:01,840 --> 00:20:03,487
especially when I'm injured.

297
00:20:04,240 --> 00:20:05,500
I'm done for.

298
00:20:20,520 --> 00:20:22,285
You're holding on by a thread.

299
00:20:22,520 --> 00:20:24,108
Stay down, you stupid mutt!

300
00:20:24,300 --> 00:20:27,217
If you keep moving or try
using your stance power,

301
00:20:27,300 --> 00:20:31,006
